            The Telematics for Autonomous Systems
          </h1>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-1">
            <span>Essay · Technical</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>7 min read</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>June 2026</span>
          </div>
